	(text "Switch chain extensions"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 275.59 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "69225b29-9404-5fe4-a3a5-3934d6d485f3")
	)
	(text "Two HUB75 panels (J25 = panel A, J26 = panel B) on 17 RP2354B lines (PIO2): 6 colour bits per panel (R1 G1 B1 R2 G2 B2),\nshared CLK, LAT, OE and 2 row-address lines (A, B). 74AHCT245 buffers on +5 V (HUB75 is 5 V logic), 33 R series resistors.\nPanel A data = DMD_D0-D5 (GPIO20-25), panel B = DMD_D6-D11 (GPIO26-31). DMD_D0-D6 also drive the original DMD buffer (J5):\nonly one display path runs at a time. HUB75 C, D, E (pins 11, 12, 8) are not connected: panels with 4-5 row lines need 3 more GPIOs.\nU31: first 74HC595 of the strobe chain (status LED, GI_SPARE, 6 spare outputs). U30: last 74HC165 of the switch chain\n(coin door memory protect + 7 spare inputs). Both share SW_CLK and SW_LOAD_N (165 load / 595 latch on one pulse)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87aeedca-a11f-5933-8c79-eb367feab6d5")
	)
